As of October 2026, there are 70 cities with at least one supertall or taller building, and 260 completed supertall or taller buildings.[[6]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Supertall_skyscraper#cite_note-6) Most supertall skyscrapers are located in Asia. The city with the most supertall or taller buildings is [Dubai](link_4) at 33 entries, followed by [Shenzhen](link_1) and [New York City](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_York_City "New York City") with 22 and 18 respectively.[[7]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Supertall_skyscraper#cite_note-7)[China](link_5) is the country with the most supertall or taller buildings at 138 entries, followed by the [United Arab Emirates](link_6) and the [United States](link_7) with 38 and 34 respectively.[[8]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Supertall_skyscraper#cite_note-8)

